    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（重甲），極珍稀（需同調）</em><br />這套護甲與外表與關節處均裝有齒輪，這些齒輪彼此咬合。它自 <strong>機械境Mechanus</strong> 的秩序魔法中汲取能量。<br />這套護甲具有4發充能。穿戴盔甲期間，每當你進行一次[[/r d20]]擲骰時，你都可以消耗1發充能將你已骰出的骰值改爲10。這套護甲在每日黎明時分恢復[[/r 1d4]]發已消耗的充能數。</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">板甲由覆蓋全身，且相互連接的模鑄金屬板組成。一套板甲包括護手、重皮靴、一頂附面甲的頭盔以及在護甲底層的厚重的布甲。其鎖釦和皮帶結構可以將護甲重量分配到身體各處。</span></p><p>The outside surface and internal joints of this armor whir with interlocking gears, drawing on the orderly magic of the plane of Mechanus.</p><p>The armor has 4 charges. If you make a [[/r d20]] roll while wearing this armor, you can expend 1 charge to change the number rolled to a 10. The armor regains [[/r 1d4]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>Plate consists of shaped, interlocking metal plates to cover the entire body. A suit of plate includes gauntlets, heavy leather boots, a visored helmet, and thick layers of padding underneath the armor. Buckles and straps distribute the weight over the body.</p></div>",
